---
/**
* The overlay the desk draws its links on: a curve from a resource in the file to the same
* resource in the picture, the ring around that node, and — on desks that show every wire — one
* thin wire per visible resource. Place it inside the positioned element that contains both the
* editor and the picture; `desk-client.ts` sizes its viewBox to that element.
*/
---

<svg class="desk-links" aria-hidden="true">
  <g data-wires></g>
  <path class="desk-links__path" d=""></path>
  <circle class="desk-links__ring" r="0"></circle>
  <circle class="desk-links__dot" r="0"></circle>
</svg>
